From: erenmakal <69559506+erenmakal@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 01:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add fork-local folia.yml configuration

Loads the fork-local configuration before server bootstrap so all optional
performance and networking behaviour is deterministic from the first tick.


diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/Main.java b/net/minecraft/server/Main.java
--- a/net/minecraft/server/Main.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/Main.java
@@ -102,6 +102,8 @@ public class Main {
                 writePidFile(pidFilePath);
             }
 
+            dev.eren.folia.config.FoliaConfig.load(); // Folia fork - local configuration
+
             // Paper start - Perf: Run CrashReport preload asynchronously
             // The actual result is discarded/irrelevant, but hardware and software info is memoized
             Thread.ofPlatform().daemon().name("CrashReport preload thread").start(CrashReport::preload);
